Avoid ColdFusion logic within HTML tags where possible<pre><code>&lt;!-- Avoid this --&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;#((totalWidgets - soldWidgets) / totalWidgets) * 100#%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;!-- This is preferrable --&gt;
&lt;cfset percentWidgetsLeft = ((totalWidgets - soldWidgets) / totalWidgets) * 100&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;#percentWidgetsLeft#%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</code></pre>

Tags are lowercase<pre><code>&lt;!-- Incorrect --&gt;
&lt;img src="/images/image.png" alt="Picture of a flower" 
    title="Picture of a flower"&gt;
&lt;!-- Correct --&gt;
&lt;img src="/images/image.png" alt="Picture of a flower" 
    title="Picture of a flower"&gt;
</code></pre> Escape special characters<pre><code>&lt;!-- Incorrect --&gt;
http://example.com/search?name=detail&amp;uid=165
&lt;!-- Correct --&gt;
http://example.com/search?name=detail&amp;amp;uid=15
</code></pre> Use a new line for every block, list, or table element, and indent every such child element<pre><code>&lt;blockquote&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        &lt;em&gt;Space&lt;/em&gt;, the final frontier.
    &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Moe&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Larry&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;Curly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Income&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;th&gt;Taxes&lt;/th&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;$5.00&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;$4.40&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
</code></pre>
